  "sourceTitle": "Hot Spiced Apple Cider",
  "sourceText": "Hot Spiced Apple Cider\nBy: Yuna Wu\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 11:16pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 gallon Apple Cider\n1 1/2 teaspoons Cinnamon\n1/2 teaspoon Ground Ginger\n1/2 teaspoon Ground Cloves\n1/2 teaspoon Ground Allspice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients and heat. This is easily accomplished in a 30 cup coffee pot.\n\nAbout\n\n\nApple Cranberry Variation: Substitue 2-3 40 oz jars of Treetop Apple-Cranberry Juice with no sugar added for the cider.",
